#209514=IFCPROPERTYSINGLEVALUE('Description',$,IFCTEXT('Designed with the ideal of complete workspace malleability, Climate enables organisations, teams and individuals to shape and personalise their work environment to suit specific needs and simply re-mould it when they change. Housing electronics, shelving and panels in a channel system independent of the work table, Climate is a unique workplace platform that evolves with businesses.'),$);
